    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Brood Brothers Auxilia",
    "summary": "Whenever an **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit of yours is picked to shoot, you may choose an enemy unit **visible** to it and up to 18\" away. If you do, for the rest of the phase:\n\n- The **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit's models may target only the chosen enemy unit, and only while it remains eligible as a target.\n- The chosen enemy unit counts as caught in overlapping fire: **GENESTEALER CULTS** models of yours add 1 to **Hit rolls** for ranged attacks against it.",
